  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building capacity for an effective sea turtle research and conservation program in the kingdom of Morocco.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The recipient will; 1. survey the coast from Agadir to Dakhla (southern Morocco) and conduct in-depth interviews with fishermen to determine current and past nesting; 2. fisheman will be trained to collect bycatch data on fisheries operating from 5 major ports ; and 3. extensive market surveys will be conducted to determine commercial importance of sea turtles.</narrative>
  </description>
